    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d18">

                <pb facs="0083" n="59" xml:id="pg59"/>

                <head>18. Memorandum From the Director for Intelligence, The Joint Staff
                    (Breitweiser) to Secretary of Defense McNamara<anchor n="0" xml:id="d18-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">J2DM–63–61</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1961-02-23">February 23,
                        1961</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>SNIE 58–61, “Probable Communist Reactions to Certain US Courses of Action
                        with Respect to Laos”<anchor n="1" xml:id="d18-f2"/></item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#flush">ENCLOSURE</p>
                <p>Brief of SNIE 58–61</p>
                <p>On 21 February 1961, the United States Intelligence Board approved an Estimate on
                    “Probable Communist Reactions to Certain US Courses of Action with Respect to
                    Laos” (SNIE 58–61). A Brief of this Estimate is attached for your information in
                    advance of the regular distribution which will be forthcoming.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">R A Breitweiser</hi><lb/>Major General,
                        USAF</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d18-a1.xml" xpointer="d18-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
